{"items": [{"text": "I worked the night shift at a gas station for one summer.", "voice": "af_heart", "speed": 0.97, "out": "E:\\HorrorStudio\\output\\_tts_cache\\af_heart_7117c494277764df.wav"}, {"text": "I quit the night the man in the yellow raincoat came back.", "voice": "af_heart", "speed": 0.834, "out": "E:\\HorrorStudio\\output\\_tts_cache\\af_heart_a07791b31ee2086f.wav"}, {"text": "Because by then, I knew what he really wanted.", "voice": "af_heart", "speed": 0.854, "out": "E:\\HorrorStudio\\output\\_tts_cache\\af_heart_314fa9cdf5b4c7db.wav"}, {"text": "Bus thirteen. Tonight's passenger...", "voice": "bm_george", "speed": 0.825, "out": "E:\\HorrorStudio\\output\\_tts_cache\\bm_george_03abc194126eb95a.wav"}, {"text": "still smells like rain.", "voice": "bm_george", "speed": 0.825, "out": "E:\\HorrorStudio\\output\\_tts_cache\\bm_george_9f8bac355a4d616c.wav"}, {"text": "It was the summer before my second year of college, and I was broke.", "voice": "af_heart", "speed": 0.97, "out": "E:\\HorrorStudio\\output\\_tts_cache\\af_heart_debbb21b27232a5d.wav"}, {"text": "So when a gas station two miles outside town offered twenty-two dollars an hour...", "voice": "af_heart", "speed": 0.97, "out": "E:\\HorrorStudio\\output\\_tts_cache\\af_heart_7a0e447e955e70fb.wav"}, {"text": "I didn't ask why.", "voice": "af_heart", "speed": 0.892, "out": "E:\\HorrorStudio\\output\\_tts_cache\\af_heart_4df131d952f7e982.wav"}, {"text": "The owner was an old man named Dale. Flannel shirt, big beard, firm handshake.", "voice": "af_heart", "speed": 0.97, "out": "E:\\HorrorStudio\\output\\_tts_cache\\af_heart_0f225332cf87672d.wav"}, {"text": "You must be Mia. Come on in, kid.", "voice": "am_fenrir", "speed": 0.97, "out": "E:\\HorrorStudio\\output\\_tts_cache\\am_fenrir_7cc58e4965f340ae.wav"}]}